00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:26.657
and the high-risk policy is to be created.

130
00:08:26.657 --> 00:08:27.832
Nothing is sent.

131
00:08:27.832 --> 00:08:31.132
Step six groups the
findings: sixteen rules.

132
00:08:31.132 --> 00:08:32.170
Look for these.

133
00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:34.660
A client secret on Case Triage Blueprint,

134
00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:37.808
and on Correspondence
Drafting's app registration.

